# rest_length/inner_radius/outer_radius only apply to a position spring
# (VirtualSpring) -- ignored (not an error) when updating a joint or pose
# spring, same as AddSpring's fields of the same name being unused outside
# VirtualSpring's own constructor.
#
# position_center/position_radius/position_stiffness only apply to a pose
# spring (PoseSpring) -- ignored (not an error) when updating a position or
# joint spring, same convention.
#
# link_name/local_point/target apply to a position or pose spring (ignored
# for a joint spring, which anchors to a joint, not a link). local_face_normal
# applies to a pose spring only. Unlike the scalar fields above, these
# change the spring's actual geometry -- applied as a direct in-place
# mutation on the already-live spring object (no Remove-then-re-Add, no
# momentary force drop).
string name
float64 stiffness
float64 damping
float64 rest_length
float64 inner_radius
float64 outer_radius
float64[3] position_center
float64 position_radius
float64 position_stiffness
string link_name
float64[3] local_point
float64[3] target
float64[3] local_face_normal
---
bool success
string message
